#: plugin.toml
msgctxt "plugin.toml"
msgid "Annotations"
msgstr "標註"

#: plugin.toml
msgctxt "plugin.toml"
msgid ""
"Point, region, line and text annotations with reusable classes, cell "
"counting, HPF fields and measurements; GeoJSON (QuPath) import and export, "
"ASAP and Aperio ImageScope XML import."
msgstr ""
"點、區域、線與文字標註，支援可重複使用的類別、細胞計數、HPF 視野與測量；可匯"
"入與匯出 GeoJSON（QuPath），並可匯入 ASAP 與 Aperio ImageScope XML。"

